//   'his enormous fist crashing through the rock, sending the lighthouse toppling'), 흰 돌 성벽은 남은 것만 물 위에 서서 기하학적 침식을 입었다 (Beneath the Surface: 'what was
//   left of it. The great lighthouse was toppled, and the wall's surface had been eroded by some geometric, iridescent blight'; Zendikar Resurgent: 'a crumbling stump of its
